# slug: ch52-emit
# source: chapters/ch52.tex:129
# label: alg:ch52-emit
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch52.tex:132
# caption: Emit a standalone C99 parser from a validated grammar.

REQUIRE grammar, validated limits, C runtime template
ENSURE deterministic C source with declared production-order search
assign stable identifiers to nonterminals and terminal expressions
FORALL terminal expressions DO
  compile expression fragments and patch their accepting exits
  emit NFA states, class tests, start index, and diagnostic spelling
END FOR
group productions by nonterminal without reordering alternatives
emit RHS symbol arrays and each nonterminal's production range
emit one wrapper per nonterminal, calling the shared choice engine
emit postorder action cases with checked substitutions
insert tables, actions, prologue, and entry point into the runtime template
write the completed translation unit and epilogue

